{"unit_id":"riverai__dsh-calibre-ebook-translator#feature-1","repo":"riverai/dsh-calibre-ebook-translator","commit":"07834324542acc8c58b5df5081a8e64d8f9237aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"书籍翻译模式的功能「分块翻译与文件归档」：每次处理一段书稿时，按顺序登记原文、生成草稿、审校并保存成品，同时更新进度、记忆和报告文件。可手动输入文本，也定义了通过 Calibre MCP 文件工具导入与回写的流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:87-104"]}
{"unit_id":"riverai__dsh-calibre-ebook-translator#feature-2","repo":"riverai/dsh-calibre-ebook-translator","commit":"07834324542acc8c58b5df5081a8e64d8f9237aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"书籍翻译模式的功能「跨段术语和记忆维护」：为每本书保存术语表、人物资料、风格要求、进度摘要和遗留事项；处理新段前要求重新读取记忆与术语文件，以保持跨会话的一致性。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:33-74","cordis.patch.yml:91-94"]}
{"unit_id":"riverai__dsh-calibre-ebook-translator#feature-3","repo":"riverai/dsh-calibre-ebook-translator","commit":"07834324542acc8c58b5df5081a8e64d8f9237aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"书籍翻译模式的功能「独立审校与修改裁定」：每段初稿都交由前台运行的独立子代理审读，主 agent 逐条说明采纳或驳回理由，再将选定修改写入审校稿并复核。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:95-104","cordis.patch.yml:107-120"]}
